{"publicId":"b46e975e-9ff5-47b7-9c9a-3992bcd6d78a","title":"OpenAI推出Images 2.6模型及GIF生成功能，开放API并提升生成量","status":"settled","reportCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-04T19:44:20.000Z","digest":"OpenAI推出基于Images 2.6模型的GIF生成功能及Flare（高效）和Sunburst（高质量）API，生成速度提升40%，复杂场景准确率提高15%，用户周均生成量超40亿张（较9月增长1亿）。\n功能包括通过文本或上传照片生成GIF，支持调整动画速度、编辑单帧及分享。API模型适用于企业级应用，但客户端集成进展（如ChatGPT的GIF功能覆盖范围）尚未披露。\n目前仅开放API调用权限，客户端集成（如ChatGPT）的GIF功能已逐步上线，覆盖网页、桌面及移动端应用（据The Verge和The Decoder报道）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T02:55:01.985Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"OpenAI 发布支持文本与照片生成动画GIF的 Images 2.6 模型","latestReport":{"id":"uvs1tn1s3b62hlve4z7ei781t"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fVgDmVusc42Q","title":"ChatGPT can now create animated GIFs","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T19:44:20.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"uvs1tn1s3b62hlve4z7ei781t","title":"OpenAI 发布支持文本与照片生成动画GIF的 Images 2.6 模型","summary":"OpenAI 推出 Images 2.6 模型，支持文本与照片生成动画GIF，并开放 Flare（高效）和 Sunburst（高质量）API 模型。用户通过 ChatGPT 和 API 每周生成图像量超40亿，较九月增长1亿。","source":{"name":"The Decoder","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T19:44:20.000Z","selected":true}},{"factId":"fHkro8npth2w","title":"更新","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T18:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"jsr54leknocd97tb0zzqoj7rm","title":"ChatGPT 新增动画 GIF 生成功能","summary":"OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 和 API 中推出图像生成升级，周均生成量超40亿张（较9月增长）。新增GIF制作功能，支持调整动画速度、编辑单帧及分享，并推出GPT-Image-2.6 Flare和Sunburst API以提升生成速度和质量。","source":{"name":"The Verge · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T18:00:00.000Z","selected":true}},{"factId":"f1wXVMgRvCEU","title":"Introducing Images 2.6","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"xke4orhnl2cofsyaa3v8w04j0","title":"OpenAI 发布 Images 2.6","summary":"OpenAI 发布 Images 2.6，提供更快的图像生成、GIF创建和更精确的编辑功能，并新增API控制选项。","source":{"nam